-- the record's reuse across chains: a cover of the chain by segments, each with its own configurations,
-- the restriction of a configuration of the chain to it, and whether the record holds that conformation
-- of the segment (obs(u), the deposited conformations of u)
Cover : Type 0 → Type 1
Cover C = (U : Type 0) × (S : U → Type 0) × ((u : U) → C → S u) × ((u : U) → S u → Bool)
